 "description": "Search wholesale fashion items listed by stalls in the Dongdaemun market, Seoul, on apMZoomAI (\uc571\uc5e0\uc90cAI). Accepts short keywords in any language (English, Korean, Chinese, Japanese, Vietnamese, Thai, Indonesian, Malay). Returns each item's name, photos, category, the stall's building, floor and stall number, and an apMZoomAI link. Prices are not available through this tool; the buyer opens the item link to see price and wholesale ordering details. Only stalls currently in business are included.",
